---
description: How to write and place encyclopedia pages
globs: content/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `docs/AUTHORING.md`. Copy `content/_templates/` and imitate canonical pages in `docs/CONTENT-MODEL.md`.

- Do not invent facts or URLs.
- Do not improvise food-safety process times. Cite NCHFP, USDA, or extension, or omit the claim.
- Do not set `status: reviewed`.
- Keep `related` to 8 or fewer.
- Quote IDs in YAML (`id: "gg:topic:sourdough"`) because colons are significant.
- Run `npm run validate` after authoring.
